{
  "id": "EZK.29",
  "number": "29",
  "bookId": "EZK",
  "reference": "Esekieli 29",
  "verseCount": 20,
  "content": [
    {
      "name": "chapter",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "number": "29",
        "style": "c",
        "sid": "EZK 29"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "29",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Ramooraneeda aba badayda Misri",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 29:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Gweaydeaba damanamughuush, bea sheedeaba damanamughuush, eaweedeaba damaniyeenya bea sheeda, hean goobaloolan ng'asheanda NG'UTAMIIDA nea gwayi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.29.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.29.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 29:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Ea orjeeda siida, afuursiina gheamamdaang'u heeda Farao, was sugoocheanda Misri, ak giramoorsi niny, ea badayda Misri sean. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.29.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.29.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 29:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Baloola nea giyeeshi, gwayi NG'UTAMIIDA was ASEETA;",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.29.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.29.3"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 29:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.29.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.29.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 29:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Nea fuga sean mida Misri gayghwanal gideaba aniini geawooschi NG'UTAMIIDA aba gideaba niiw diigheecheanda ghus fuga Israeli. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.29.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.29.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 29:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hean nea ghoang'waanyi aba geatinda, gigishachi, ak giruusi haluuleeka nyaawa, damanda bwataawaneey gigishachi nea ginung' ghaboadan mananuunatka nyaawa. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.29.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.29.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 29:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Asi gwayi NG'UTAMIIDA was ASEETA, ng'ula, gaydeaneey ng'ucheeda. Ak gaydabwar buuneeda ea diyeanga. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.29.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.29.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 29:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ak ng'eanyiida Misri gayghoah raghoonyeanda ea dareapcheeda. Ak saawa gayghwanal gideaba aniini geawooschi NG'UTAMIIDA.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.29.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.29.9"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 29:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Aba gideaba giyeeni ‘deanyu gil, ak geasinyi aniini.’ ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.29.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.29.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 29:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Asi ng'ula, aniini geawooschi haweewaneey ea eenigaagu, ak gaydanung' ghoah ng'eanyiida Misri dareapcheeda manda gil ea raghoonyeanda, ghang'eada Migdoli ea ghwahita Sewene ea ghwahita moonghooda ng'eanyiida Gushi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.29.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.29.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 29:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ak ea manda siida jea ghang'ata gwasik jeedida, nea ea manda diyeayda jea ghang'ata gwasik jeedida. Ak ea maygoobiida buuneeda gweanyeew haradam. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.29.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.29.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 29:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ak gaydanung' ghoah ng'eanyiida Misri raghoonyeanda, aba jeeda darooraka was raghoonyeanda, ea mujiinajeagaaschi, aba jeeda mujiinajeega eemeega, maygwanda gil gweanyeew haradam. Ak gaydeadearsa fuga Misri jeeda eemoojiga nea ghaanung' ghwadarda aba bugusta darooraka.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.29.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.29.12"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 29:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.29.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.29.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 29:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Aba gideaba gwayi NG'UTAMIIDA was ASEETA, muudeanooda gweanyeew haradam, abeeda gaydabwadageat fuga Misri, nea gearuuteawi jeeda eemoojiga ghayi darsa jeenyaawa. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.29.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.29.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 29:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ak gaydeadeelu fuga Misri ghayi mida ghealooniga, ak gaydeadeelsa gaweay ng'eanyiida Batirosi ghayi sijiilsa, nea aba hoowa sugoocheanduumeeda nyaawa ea maygwanda uurda. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.29.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.29.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 29:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Gajea manda uurda ea ghang'al sugoocheanduumajeega sean, nea maygut goodiing'u geaw aba heeda eemoojiga. Ak saawa gaydanung' gang'ayiit ea maygut goombaliischi gicha aba heeda eemoojiga. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.29.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.29.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 29:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Misri abeeda maygut gwandeawa uurda, ak fuga Israeli ea maygut ghabwat fuga Misri, ak fuga Israeli gayghoapkaat giidiinyeanda nyaawa, aba gideaba saawa ghayi ghabwat fuga Misri, ak fuga Israeli gayghwanal gideaba aniini geawooschi NG'UTAMIIDA was ASEETA.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.29.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.29.16"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Nebukadinesa was sugoocheanda gayghwajoar Misri",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 29:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.29.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.29.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 29:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hean gweaydeaba diktam ea ispwa bea sheeda madeeda, nea eaweeda madeeda bea sheeda gil, hean goobaloolan ng'asheanda NG'UTAMIIDA nea gwayi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.29.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.29.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 29:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Ea orjeeda siida, Nebukadinesa was sugoocheanda Babeli, ghoadaw lugoadaanyi gadiyeeda hang'waay bea ng'eesiinda Diro. Iheenga sean bea lugoadaanyi ghwanyas mearuumeeda nea ghafurinyaada haluuleeka sean. Nea niny ea lugoadaanyi ea mwanyasa gil aba ng'eanyiida Diro. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.29.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.29.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 29:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Asi gwayi NG'UTAMIIDA was ASEETA, ng'ula, gaydaadaw ng'eanyiida Misri Nebukadinesa was sugoocheanda Babeli, ak gaygageanda haleanjeadaanyi sean, nea gageanda meanang'oocheanduumeeda Misri ghoah mushahareeda lugoadaanyi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.29.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.29.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 29:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Naadawji niny ng'eanyiida Misri ghoah waldeayda gadiyeadaanyi, aba gideaba lugoadaanyi gwasin gadiyeeda aba badaydeanyu. Gwarugu NG'UTAMIIDA was ASEETA.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.29.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.29.20"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 29:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.29.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.29.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 29:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Eaweedida gaydaadaw fuga Israeli uurda, ak gaydanung' amuusa baloola aba bugusta nyaawa. Ak saawa gayghwanal gideaba aniini geawooschi NG'UTAMIIDA.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.29.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.29.21"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
